    "source": "arena",
    "type": "block",
    "title": "card-expiration-date-2024-02-15-0125.mp3",
    "text": "i was walking with my head held high\nfoot after foot\nmaking good pace as i would\ni was stumbling with my eyes shut\ni shoulda never looked\nbut one night in delirium\npoems i should never have read\ni've fallen down the fucking stairs\nmy heels over head",
    "url": "https://www.are.na/block/29723261",
