    "title": "if-this-is-what-youve-been-dealing-with-2024-01-20-1800.mp3",
    "text": "the weight of a blanket and the world on my head,\nstill curled in my bed\nthinking of answers for the questions you said\nbefore they led to\naches in my skin\ncracks on my lips\npainful morning\nwhen it's grey out and it's pouring",
