    "title": "nob-hill-2023-09-13-0057.mp3",
    "text": "in your nob hill apartment\nwe were baking with parchment\nand you felt like an artist\ncuz there was batter on the carpet\nand i met you on a tuesday\ni was loving you by wednesday\ni dont care what my friends say\nwe were listening to our songs\nand we'd write the words on card stock\n(from the cigar shop)\nyeah i thought i felt my heart stop\ncuz you're my brand of self care\nso all we need is the hotel fare\n(and maybe healthcare)\ndont need to look elsewhere",
